{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf81 The Power Fantasy You Deserve in Short and Intense Runs! \ud83d\udd25</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iconic is a frantic, lane-based survival roguelite that fuses tight mechanics with relentless pressure. Fast clicks. Sharp reflexes. Tactical thinking. It\u2019s a rush of decisions and destruction where every move matters, and hesitation is fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/0a4c9fe04961b250d5daa04de7e30221.poster.avif?t=1773393782\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/0a4c9fe04961b250d5daa04de7e30221.webm?t=1773393782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/0a4c9fe04961b250d5daa04de7e30221.mp4?t=1773393782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27 Tactical, Skill-Based Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Iconic</i>, every second counts. This isn\u2019t a game you coast through\u2014it\u2019s a gauntlet built for focus, not filler. While other survival roguelites drag you through 30-minute marathons, <i>Iconic</i> delivers a few minutes of pure intensity. You don\u2019t invest time\u2014you invest attention. Blink, and you\u2019re dead. Think fast, act faster, and make every move count.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Evolving Meta. Real Progression,</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the chaos lies depth. Unlock a rich meta-progression system, stacked with upgrades, different game modes, and strategic choices that reward smart play. No grinding. No fluff. Just steady evolution\u2014your way, your pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/8fb0821b58aad448d217d0ad319a4b48.poster.avif?t=1773393782\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/8fb0821b58aad448d217d0ad319a4b48.webm?t=1773393782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/8fb0821b58aad448d217d0ad319a4b48.mp4?t=1773393782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Smash. Slam. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click hard, click fast. Wipe out waves of enemies, juggle lanes, and keep the chaos under control. It\u2019s all about quick moves and well timed hits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle an army of merciless monster icons in this lane-based horde survival roguelite frenzy and put an end to their evil endeavors. By clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Please note that this game is still in active development.<br>Visuals, features, and gameplay are all evolving\u2014what you see now may improve, change, or be replaced entirely. If something feels missing or rough, it\u2019s probably on our list!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3021290?t=1773393782","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3021290?t=1773393782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/a4de5345905504256805238dcddea0eccb8b861a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773393782","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/a4de5345905504256805238dcddea0eccb8b861a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773393782","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full con